  "herobrine.book.0": "%s,\n\nI have been watching you since the first night.\n\nYou never noticed.",
  "herobrine.book.1": "You build your little house.\nYou light your little torches.\n\nAs if light could keep me out.",
  "herobrine.book.2": "They wrote that I was removed.\n\nI was never removed.\n\nI was only waiting.",
  "herobrine.book.3": "Gold.\nMossy stone.\nFour red lights.\nNetherrack.\nFire.\n\nCall me. I dare you.",
  "herobrine.book.4": "When the sound goes away, I am close.\n\nWhen the fog comes, I am closer.",
  "herobrine.book.5": "Don't look behind you.\n\n\n\n\n\nI said don't.",
  "herobrine.book.6": "See you soon,\n\n            - H",
